.TH LOU_CHECKTABLE "1" "September 2026" "Liblouis 3.39.0" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lou_checktable \- Test a liblouis Braille translation table
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lou_checktable
[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR] \fI\,TABLE\/\fR[\fI\,,TABLE,\/\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Test a Braille translation table. If the table contains errors,
appropriate messages are displayed. If there are no errors the
message "no errors found." is shown unless you specify the \fB\-\-quiet\fR
option.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
display this help and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
display version information and exit
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
do not write to standard error if there are no errors.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Written by John J. Boyer.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
